17.521" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.879" end="13.547">Ти</span><span begin="13.547" end="13.877">хо,</span> <span begin="13.877" end="14.207">сон</span><span begin="14.207" end="14.545">но</span> <span begin="14.545" end="14.941">ре</span><span begin="14.941" end="15.535">ка</span> <span begin="15.535" end="15.925">те</span><span begin="15.925" end="16.059">чёт,</span> <span begin="16.329" end="16.659">а</span> <span begin="16.659" end="17.005">в ре</span> <span begin="17.005" end="17.521">ке</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">河水静谧而慵懒地流淌</span></p><p begin="17.791" end="20.941" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.791" end="18.113">Ру</span><span begin="18.113" end="18.421">сал</span><span begin="18.421" end="18.773">ка</span> <span begin="18.773" end="19.111">по</span><span begin="19.111" end="20.941">ёт</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">水中的人鱼在低声吟唱</span></p><p begin="21.271" end="22.937" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.271" end="21.467">Го</span><span begin="21.467" end="21.601">ло</span><span begin="21.601" end="21.773">сок</span> <span begin="21.773" end="21.917">е</span><span begin="21.917" end="22.097">ё</span> <span begin="22.231" end="22.599">го</span><span begin="22.599" end="22.937">рек</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的声音凄苦哀婉</span></p><p begin="23.145" end="25.021" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.145" end="23.303">И</span> <span begin="23.303" end="23.445">пе</span><span begin="23.445" end="23.655">сен</span><span begin="23.655" end="23.805">ка</span> <span begin="23.805" end="23.987">пол</span><span begin="23.987" end="24.165">на</span> <span begin="24.165" end="24.345">тос</span><span begin="24.345" end="24.683">ко</span><span begin="24.683" end="25.021">ю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">歌声中满溢着忧伤</span></p><p begin="25.404" end="27.152" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.404" end="25.554">Что</span> <span begin="25.554" end="25.726">лу</span><span begin="25.726" end="25.906">на</span> <span begin="25.906" end="26.102">зо</span><span begin="26.102" end="26.244">вет</span> <span begin="26.244" end="26.432">по</span><span begin="26.432" end="26.668">ро</span><span begin="26.768" end="27.152">ю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明月有时在将她呼唤</span></p><p begin="27.397" end="29.425" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.397" end="27.555">Но</span> <span begin="27.555" end="27.697">так</span> <span begin="27.697" end="27.871">вы</span><span begin="27.871" end="28.043">со́</span><span begin="28.043" end="28.223">ко</span> <span begin="28.223" end="28.373">над</span> <span begin="28.373" end="28.583">во</span><span begin="28.583" end="28.803">до</span><span begin="28.937" end="29.425">ю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可月亮悬在水面之上</span></p><p begin="29.657" end="31.421" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.657" end="29.815">Так</span> <span begin="29.815" end="30.017">вы</span><span begin="30.017" end="30.197">со́</span><span begin="30.197" end="30.333">ко</span> <span begin="30.333" end="30.475">над</span> <span begin="30.475" end="30.671">во</span><span begin="30.671" end="30.873">до</span><span begin="31.015" end="31.421">ю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样远、那样远，在水面之上</span></p><p begin="31.652" end="33.384" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.652" end="31.780">Да</span> <span begin="31.780" end="31.922">над</span> <span begin="31.922" end="32.094">во</span><span begin="32.094" end="32.238">до</span><span begin="32.238" end="32.424">ю</span> <span begin="32.424" end="32.568">ле</span><span begin="32.568" end="32.740">дя</span><span begin="32.740" end="33.114">но</span><span begin="33.114" end="33.384">ю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高悬在那冰冷刺骨的水面之上</span></p><p begin="33.384" end="37.620" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.384" end="33.790">Что</span> <span begin="33.790" end="34.344">ей</span> <span begin="34.344" end="34.480">ни</span><span begin="34.480" end="34.848">ко</span><span begin="34.848" end="35.342">гда</span> <span begin="35.342" end="35.514">не</span> <span begin="35.514" end="35.805">до</span><span begin="35.805" end="37.620">стать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远在她永远也无法触及的地方</span></p><p begin="37.607" end="41.791" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.607" end="37.989">Лу</span><span begin="37.989" end="38.829">ну</span> <span begin="39.047" end="39.369">я</span> <span begin="39.369" end="39.541">бе</span><span begin="39.541" end="39.715">лой</span> <span begin="39.715" end="39.887">пе</span><span begin="39.887" end="40.105">ной</span> <span begin="40.105" end="40.727">за</span><span begin="40.727" end="41.095">плес</span><span begin="41.095" end="41.791">ну</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要将浪花泼洒到月亮前</span></p><p begin="42.139" end="45.464" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.139" end="42.889">И</span> <span begin="42.889" end="43.228">под</span> <span begin="43.228" end="43.724">во</span><span begin="43.724" end="43.858">ду,</span> <span begin="43.858" end="44.226">под</span> <span begin="44.226" end="44.782">тём</span><span begin="44.782" end="44.954">ну</span><span begin="44.954" end="45.126">ю</span> <span begin="45.126" end="45.298">у</span><span begin="45.298" end="45.464">йду</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着它沉入那幽暗的水底</span></p><p begin="45.562" end="47.076" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.562" end="45.688">Ту</span><span begin="45.688" end="45.846">да,</span> <span begin="45.846" end="46.018">на</span> <span begin="46.018" end="46.192">глу</span><span begin="46.192" end="46.372">би</span><span begin="46.372" end="47.076">ну</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去向水的深处</span></p><p begin="47.368" end="50.308" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent=